%N A397653 Number of equivalence classes of n X n binary matrices under cyclic permutations and complementations of rows and columns.
%C A397653 The acting group is C_2^(2*n-1) semidirect C_n^2, of order n^2*2^(2*n-1).
%F A397653 a(n) = (1/(n^2*2^(2*n-1)))*Sum_{d|n} Sum_{e|n} phi(d)*phi(e)*K(n,d,e)*2^(n^2/lcm(d,e)) where
%F A397653   K(n,d,e) = 2^(2*n-n/d-1) if d/g is even and e/g is odd,
%F A397653   K(n,d,e) = 2^(2*n-n/e-1) if d/g is odd and e/g is even,
%F A397653   K(n,d,e) = 2^(2*n-n/d-n/e) if d/g and e/g are odd,
%F A397653 with g = gcd(d,e).
%e A397653 For n = 3, representatives of the four equivalence classes are [000,000,000], [000,000,001], [000,001,010], and [000,001,011]. Thus a(3) = 4.
%Y A397653 Cf. A179043 (without row and column complementations).
%K A397653 nonn,new
%O A397653 1,2
%A A397653 _Vladeta Jovovic_, Sep 28 2026
